      "id": "safe_mass_calculator",
      "content": "## Maximum Safe Mass Calculator\n\nCalculate the maximum safe mass that a polyester rope can support using the formula:\n\n**m = F / g**\n\nWhere:\n- F = Safe Load force (kN)\n- g = acceleration of gravity (9.81 m/s²)\n- m = mass (kg)",
